  "question": "Where can I find a university that are within 180 kilometers and lie south of Country Inn & Suites, Springfield, IL?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.608253 39.757227)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.608253 39.757227)',4326)::geography, 180000)\nAND amenity = 'university'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 157.5 AND 202.5;\n",
